  "releaseNotes": "## v1.1.3 (patch)\n\nChanges since v1.1.2:\n\n- Refuse a timer-backed timing longer than about 49.7 days [patch] (#122) (matt-edmondson)\n- Take each upstream's allow-list whole from the source that wins it [patch] (#123) (matt-edmondson)\n- Match a backwards bracket range's first character, as git branch --list does [patch] (#125) (matt-edmondson)",
